title: Vehicle Power Down 30-Minute Timer Disable
raw_community_title: ⚡ [Lightning] Vehicle Power Down 30-Minute Timer Disable
category: Powertrain and Drivetrain
platform: F-150 Lightning
model_years: 2022-2026
trim: All
source_sheet: 2021-2026 F150.xlsx
notes: '[Category: Powertrain and Drivetrain] [Years: 2022-2026] [Original Title:
  Disable Vehicle Power Down Timer at Start]

  Defaults the 30-minute idle shutdown timer to off at startup. 2022-2024 Lightnings
  with ACC will have ''F''; trucks without ACC will have ''C''.'
steps:
- module: IPC
  address: 720-01-01
  targets:
  - mask: x*xx xxxx xx--
    type: discrete
    bits:
    - bit: 3
      action: 0
      feature: AEIS With Override (AEISWO)
recipe_version: '1.1'
